            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[- Fixed: the dictation pill stopped showing over full-screen apps after a full-screen Space closed, until OpenVocally restarted.
- Fixed: deleting a model while it installed, or changing a model's language during a check, could leave the model in the wrong state.
- Fixed: the update notice in the sidebar cut off its title. The version now shows on its own line.
]]></description>
